    "sentence_translations": [
      "The White Starbucks",
      "",
      "In Tokyo, Japan, Starbucks opened a white limited time store, which was only open for about three weeks.",
      "",
      "This is the first entirely white Starbucks in Japan.",
      "This Starbucks was white both inside and outside like white snow, and the lighting resembled the sun in the winter.",
      "The café's inside had white sound absorbing material to reduce noise, and created a feeling of a peaceful snow landscape.",
      "\"Winter sounds\" were also playing inside the store, which gave people entering this Starbucks a true feeling of being in a snow landscape.",
      "",
      "However because this Starbucks café became too popular, each day it was filled with people.",
      "And thus the only feeling people got was that of a \"rather crowded snow landscape\", and not one of peacefulness."
    ]
